---
title: 猫又が処刑されると curse_kill event が emit される (道連れ)
setup: { nekomata: 1, werewolf: 1, villager: 2 }
---
# Day 1 投票で Alice (猫又) 処刑 → engine が curse-on-executed trait を発動し、
# 生存者から random で 1 人を道連れ → curse_kill event 発火。
# 道連れ target は random なので個別 target は verify せず event 発火のみ確認。

++Alice、Bob、Carol、Dave
!Alice=猫又
!Bob=人狼
!Carol=村人
!Dave=村人

# == engine: Night 0 ==
# peace (襲撃が attack-immune で無効)
# == end ==

Alice→Alice
Bob→Alice
Carol→Alice
Dave→Alice

# == engine: Day 1 ==
# vote tally: Alice 3 / Dave 1 → execution=Alice
# chain (curse_kill): Dave died
# == end ==
# == engine: Final ==
# result: werewolf_won
# survivors: Bob, Carol
# == end ==

# @expect-event curse_kill
